<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>OCPP Labs — SDM Backend Infrastructure</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-color: #0A0B10;
      --card-bg: rgba(22, 24, 34, 0.6);
      --card-border: rgba(37, 41, 58, 0.8);
      --accent-blue: #3B82F6;
      --accent-green: #00FF66;
      --text-main: #FFFFFF;
      --text-muted: #8A8F9E;
      --text-dim: #5A5E73;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-color);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      position: relative;
      line-height: 1.6;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    /* Animated background */
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -10%;
      right: -10%;
      width: 600px;
      height: 600px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: -1;
    }
    body::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -10%;
      left: -10%;
      width: 500px;
      height: 500px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.06) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: -1;
    }

    /* HEADER */
    header.navbar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 20px 5%;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      background: rgba(10, 11, 16, 0.8);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .logo-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      color: #FFF;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .logo-icon {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      background: rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-green);
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    nav.desktop-nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    nav.desktop-nav a {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    nav.desktop-nav a:hover {
      color: #FFF;
    }

    .burger-btn {
      display: none;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
      background: none;
      border: none;
    }

    .burger-btn span {
      display: block;
      width: 25px;
      height: 2px;
      background: #FFF;
      border-radius: 2px;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    /* MOBILE DRAWER MENU */
    .mobile-menu {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      right: -100%;
      width: 280px;
      height: 100%;
      background: #161822;
      border-left: 1px solid #25293A;
      z-index: 1000;
      padding: 40px 24px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
      transition: right 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      box-shadow: -10px 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }

    .mobile-menu.active {
      right: 0;
    }

    .mobile-menu-close {
      align-self: flex-end;
      font-size: 28px;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .mobile-menu a {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #FFF;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    .menu-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      z-index: 999;
      display: none;
    }

    .menu-overlay.active {
      display: block;
    }

    /* MAIN CONTENT / HERO */
    main {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 80px 24px;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin-bottom: 80px;
    }

    .badge-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
      border-radius: 30px;
      color: var(--accent-blue);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 64px);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF 0%, #A1A1AA 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .hero-p {
      font-size: clamp(16px, 3vw, 20px);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 40px;
    }

    .cta-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: #FFF;
      color: #000;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #E4E4E7;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: #FFF;
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    /* FEATURES SECTION */
    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin-bottom: 80px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 32px;
      transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }
    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
    }

    .feat-icon {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* ENDPOINTS DISPLAY */
    .endpoints-box {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 700px;
      background: #0D0E15;
      border: 1px solid rgba(37, 41, 58, 1);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 24px;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 13px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    .code-comment { color: var(--text-dim); }
    .code-green { color: var(--accent-green); }
    .code-blue { color: var(--accent-blue); }
    .code-row { margin-bottom: 12px; }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      padding: 40px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 24px;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: #FFF; }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav.desktop-nav { display: none; }
      .burger-btn { display: flex; }
      .cta-group { flex-direction: column; width: 100%; max-width: 300px; margin: 0 auto; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header class="navbar">
    <a href="/" class="logo-group">
      <div class="logo-icon">🔒</div>
      <span>OCPP LABS</span>
    </a>

    <nav class="desktop-nav">
      <a href="/">Infrastructure</a>
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/imprint">Imprint</a>
    </nav>

    <button class="burger-btn" id="burgerBtn" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">
      <span></span>
      <span></span>
      <span></span>
    </button>
  </header>

  <div class="menu-overlay" id="menuOverlay" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()"></div>
  <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
    <div class="mobile-menu-close" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">&times;</div>
    <a href="/" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">Infrastructure</a>
    <a href="/privacy" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">Privacy Policy</a>
    <a href="/imprint" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">Imprint / Legal</a>
  </div>

  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="badge-pill">Secure Dynamic Messaging</div>
      <h1>Next-Gen NFC <br/> Authenticity Stack</h1>
      <p class="hero-p">
        End-to-end enterprise node verifying NTAG 424 DNA cryptograms via hardware generated AES-128-CMAC triggers. 
        Decentralized trust starts here.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-group">
        <a href="/privacy" class="btn btn-primary">Review Privacy</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/xheen908/sdm-backend-js" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">GitHub Source</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feat-icon">⚡</span>
        <h3>Secure Dynamic Messaging</h3>
        <p>Implements real-time processing of SUN mirrors utilizing native Node v22 cryptographic pipelines for sub-millisecond latency verification.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feat-icon">🔐</span>
        <h3>Cryptographic Engine</h3>
        <p>Supports advanced multi-key derivation architectures including native PBKDF2 and NIST-SP-800-108 standard key dispersion hierarchies.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <span class="feat-icon">🛡️</span>
        <h3>Anti-Cloning Tech</h3>
        <p>Detects replica attacks through rigid monotonically increasing hardware counter verification preventing session recording.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="endpoints-box">
      <div class="code-comment">// API ARCHITECTURE ENDPOINTS</div>
      <div style="height: 12px;"></div>
      <div class="code-row">
        <span class="code-green">GET /tag?p={PICC}&c={MAC}</span><br/>
        <span class="code-comment">// Evaluates browser-level incoming SDM triggers</span>
      </div>
      <div class="code-row">
        <span class="code-green">GET /tag/:uid?p={PICC}&c={MAC}</span><br/>
        <span class="code-comment">// Standard route invoked via mobile clients</span>
      </div>
      <div class="code-row">
        <span class="code-blue">GET /api/tag</span><br/>
        <span class="code-comment">// Programmatic headless JSON output access</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> OCPP Labs Infrastructure Division.</div>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/imprint">Imprint</a>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    function toggleMobileMenu() {
      document.getElementById('mobileMenu').classList.toggle('active');
      document.getElementById('menuOverlay').classList.toggle('active');
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
